<view class="page"><view class="hero"><text class="title">数据管理</text><text class="subtitle">核对每一张账单，记录每一次修改。</text></view><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><view class="card"><picker mode="date" value="{{date}}" bindchange="date"><view class="picker">统计归档日期：{{date}}　›</view></picker><view wx:if="{{summary}}"><view class="grid"><view><text class="metric-label">正式实收（元）</text><text class="metric">{{summary.money}}</text></view><view><text class="metric-label">有效账单</text><text class="metric">{{summary.settled}}</text></view><view><text class="metric-label">平均单笔（元）</text><text class="metric">{{summary.average}}</text></view><view><text class="metric-label">今日识别完成率</text><text class="metric">{{summary.completion}}</text></view></view><view class="muted">累计账单 {{summary.total_bills}} · 累计待复核 {{summary.pending}} · 疑似重复 {{summary.duplicates}} · 今日失败 {{summary.failed}}</view><view class="muted">识别完成率不代表字段准确率。</view></view><button class="secondary" bindtap="refresh" loading="{{busy}}">刷新统计</button></view><view class="grid"><button data-page="bills" bindtap="go">全部账单</button><button bindtap="pending">待复核</button><button data-page="exceptions" bindtap="go">异常处理</button><button data-page="stats" bindtap="go">趋势与房间统计</button></view><button data-page="agent" bindtap="go">本地业务分析 / Agent</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="settings">连接、导出与备份</button><view class="notice">正式营业额仅包含已结、已复核且没有重复争议的账单；图表表示已采集样本。</view></view>
